@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Contact Us
	Frontend testing for the www contact us form

Scenario: Submit Contact Us Form
	End users should be able to fill and submit the contact us form via contact us footer link.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the footer "Contact us" link
	Then I should be able to view the Contact Us page and form
	When I populate and submit the Contact Us form with the following values
	| Work Email                         | usr.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country                            | United States                      |
	| State/Territory                    | California                         |
	| What would you like to talk about? | Test request contact               |
	| Whats your challenge?              | Increasing B2B online revenue      |
	| First Name                         | USR                                |
	| Last Name                          | Contact1                           |
	| Company                            | Usrcont                            |
	| Phone                              | 555-555-5678                       |
	| Industry                           | Technology                         |
	| Company Revenue                    | $10 million - $100 million         |
	| Department                         | Engineering/IT                     |
	| Job Role                           | Developer/Engineer                 |
	| Company Size                       | 5,001 - 10,000                     |
	| Job Title                          | Engineering                        |
	And I wait for "5" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a message stating that the contact form was sent
	And the current url content should contain the text "contact-us/thank-you"